<title>BRAZIL: MOTORCYCLING-BRAZILIAN 500CC GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTORCYCLING-BRAZILIAN 500CC GRAND PRIX QUALIFYING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Qualifying times on Friday</p>
<p>on the first day of practice for Sunday's Brazilian 500cc</p>
<p>motorcycling Grand Prix:</p>
<p> 1. Michael Doohan (Australia) Honda     one minute 52.552</p>
<p>seconds (average speed 157.783 kilometres per hour)</p>
<p> 2. Doriano Romboni (Italy) Aprilia		   1:53.586</p>
<p> 3. Luca Cadalora (Italy) Yamaha			1:53.785</p>
<p> 4. Tadayuki Okada (Japan) Honda			1:53.815</p>
<p> 5. Carlos Checa (Spain) Honda			  1:54.102</p>
<p> 6. Daryl Beattie (Australia) Suzuki		  1:54.107</p>
<p> 7. Alex Barros (Brazil) Honda			  1:54.286</p>
<p> 8. Nobuatsu Aoki (Japan) Honda			 1:54.526</p>
<p> 9. Anthony Gobert (Australia) Suzuki		 1:54.547</p>
<p> 10. Jean Michel Bayle (France) Modenas KR3	 1:54.810</p>
